      en: ["Originally named Cuicul.", "Famous for its Roman mosaics.", "A former Roman military camp whose well-preserved ruins blend into the mountainous landscape of northern Algeria.", "Located within the People's Democratic Republic of Algeria.", "Plays a role in the local identity of the region.", "Known for its scenic or cultural significance.", "Documented in local and regional studies."]
